# Vettr UI styling

When editing Vettr web UI under `web/`:

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/vettr-ui/SKILL.md`.
2. Use CSS variables from `web/src/styles/global.css` (`--bg-primary`, `--bg-secondary`, `--bg-tertiary`, `--text-primary`, `--text-secondary`, `--border`, `--primary`).
3. Do **not** introduce Alpine Coast colors (`#1a3a50`, `#dde2e7`, `#4a8fa8`, white form bars) into CRM/dashboard chrome.
4. Match existing `.crm-*`, `.tab-btn`, `.btn-primary`, `.modal-input` patterns.
